    "introduction": "A diffuser's fan and battery are common faults in a diffuser breaking down. The fan keeps the internals of the device, like the motherboard, from overheating. In this guide, we replace a fan from a Blossom Ultrasonic Essential Oil Diffuser ARM-510GY.\nBefore disassembling the diffuser, make sure there is no oil or water left in the diffuser and make sure the diffuser is unplugged.\n_Through a series of troubleshooting and overhaul, the problem was found to be in the cotton swab of the humidifier._\n**Product model:** K5\n**Product Name** : K5 humidifier\n**Rated voltage:** 5V=1A\n**Input interface** : USB\n**Spray time** :4 hours\nBefore beginning the repair be sure to unplug from the power source.",
